{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-57318","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66321","text":"SpecPrompt Documentation"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57320","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66322","marks":["bold"],"text":"Prompts are transient. Specs persist."}]}],"id":"blk-57319","kind":"quote"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57322","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66323","marks":["bold"],"text":"Part of the [&] Protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-66324","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-66325","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/ECOSYSTEM.md"}],"text":"Ecosystem overview"},{"id":"spn-66326","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-66327","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/PULSE/docs/THREE_PROTOCOL_STACK.md"}],"text":"Three-protocol stack"},{"id":"spn-66328","text":" · "},{"id":"spn-66329","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/STACK_COMPLETION.md"}],"text":"Stack status"}]}],"id":"blk-57321","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-57323","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66330","text":"Welcome to the documentation hub for "},{"id":"spn-66331","marks":["bold"],"text":"SpecPrompt"},{"id":"spn-66332","text":" — an open standard and toolchain for spec-driven AI development. SpecPrompt defines a Markdown-based specification format (SPEC.md) that is both human-readable and machine-parseable, serving as the source of truth for agent behavior."}]},{"id":"blk-57324","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66333","text":"SpecPrompt is the "},{"id":"spn-66334","marks":["bold"],"text":"standards layer"},{"id":"spn-66335","text":" of the [&] Protocol ecosystem — the format that bridges agent definition with execution, testing, and deployment."}]},{"id":"blk-57325","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66336","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-57326","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66337","text":"Why SpecPrompt?"}]},{"id":"blk-57327","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66338","text":"Spec-Driven Development (SDD) has emerged as the industry consensus for AI-assisted development in 2026. GitHub Spec Kit, AWS Kiro, Cursor rules, and Next Moca ADL all use different specification formats. Teams switching tools lose context."}]},{"id":"blk-57328","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66339","text":"SpecPrompt defines the interoperable standard — a Markdown-native format that is:"}]},{"id":"blk-57329","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66340","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-66341","marks":["bold"],"text":"Markdown-native"},{"id":"spn-66342","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-66343","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-66344","text":" files, no proprietary format 2. "},{"id":"spn-66345","marks":["bold"],"text":"Human-first"},{"id":"spn-66346","text":" — readable by any team member, parseable by any agent 3. "},{"id":"spn-66347","marks":["bold"],"text":"Versioned"},{"id":"spn-66348","text":" — lives in git. Branching, diffing, merging. 4. "},{"id":"spn-66349","marks":["bold"],"text":"Testable"},{"id":"spn-66350","text":" — acceptance criteria are machine-executable 5. "},{"id":"spn-66351","marks":["bold"],"text":"Composable"},{"id":"spn-66352","text":" — specs reference other specs 6. "},{"id":"spn-66353","marks":["bold"],"text":"Tool-agnostic"},{"id":"spn-66354","text":" — works with any SDD-compatible tool"}]},{"id":"blk-57330","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66355","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-57331","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66356","text":"Documentation Map"}]},{"id":"blk-57332","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Homepages\n\n[&] Ampersand Box <https://ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous <https://graphonomous.com>\nBendScript <https://bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems <https://webhost.systems>\nAgentelic <https://agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic <https://agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic <https://delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic <https://deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt <https://fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic <https://geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience <https://opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt <https://specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock <https://ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-57333","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 1\n:caption: Root Docs\n\n[&] Protocol Docs <https://docs.ampersandboxdesign.com>\nGraphonomous Docs <https://docs.graphonomous.com>\nBendScript Docs <https://docs.bendscript.com>\nWebHost.Systems Docs <https://docs.webhost.systems>\nAgentelic Docs <https://docs.agentelic.com>\nAgenTroMatic Docs <https://docs.agentromatic.com>\nDelegatic Docs <https://docs.delegatic.com>\nDeliberatic Docs <https://docs.deliberatic.com>\nFleetPrompt Docs <https://docs.fleetprompt.com>\nGeoFleetic Docs <https://docs.geofleetic.com>\nOpenSentience Docs <https://docs.opensentience.org>\nSpecPrompt Docs <https://docs.specprompt.com>\nTickTickClock Docs <https://docs.ticktickclock.com>"},{"id":"blk-57334","kind":"code","language":"text","text":":maxdepth: 2\n:caption: SpecPrompt Docs\n\nspec/README"},{"id":"blk-57335","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66357","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-57336","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66358","text":"The SPEC.md Format"}]},{"id":"blk-57337","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66359","text":"Every spec follows a structured Markdown format with YAML frontmatter:"}]},{"id":"blk-57338","kind":"code","language":"markdown","text":"---\nname: agent-name\nversion: 1.0.0\nruntime: opensentience | any\nauthor: team-or-person\ncreated: 2026-01-15\nupdated: 2026-02-22\ntags: [category, domain]\ndependencies:\n  - graphonomous\n---\n\n## Purpose\nWhat this agent does and why.\n\n## Capabilities\n- capability:scope (description)\n\n## Constraints\n- Hard and soft behavioral boundaries\n\n## Acceptance Tests\n- Given [precondition] -> [expected behavior]"},{"id":"blk-57339","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66360","marks":["bold"],"text":"Required sections:"},{"id":"spn-66361","text":" Purpose, Capabilities, Constraints, Acceptance Tests."}]},{"id":"blk-57340","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66362","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-57341","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66363","text":"Toolchain"}]},{"id":"blk-57342","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66364","text":"CLI"}]},{"id":"blk-57343","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"specprompt validate SPEC.md      # Validate against format standard\nspecprompt lint SPEC.md          # Check for best practices\nspecprompt test-gen SPEC.md      # Generate test scaffolding\nspecprompt diff SPEC.md@v1 SPEC.md@v2  # Diff two versions\nspecprompt publish SPEC.md       # Publish to FleetPrompt registry"},{"id":"blk-57344","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66365","text":"MCP Tools"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-57346","spans":[{"id":"spn-66366","text":"Tool"}]},{"id":"blk-57347","spans":[{"id":"spn-66367","text":"Description"}]}],"id":"blk-57345","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-57348","spans":[{"id":"spn-66368","marks":["code"],"text":"spec_validate"}]},{"id":"blk-57349","spans":[{"id":"spn-66369","text":"Validate against format standard"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57350","spans":[{"id":"spn-66370","marks":["code"],"text":"spec_lint"}]},{"id":"blk-57351","spans":[{"id":"spn-66371","text":"Check for best practices"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57352","spans":[{"id":"spn-66372","marks":["code"],"text":"spec_generate"}]},{"id":"blk-57353","spans":[{"id":"spn-66373","text":"Generate from natural language"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57354","spans":[{"id":"spn-66374","marks":["code"],"text":"spec_test_gen"}]},{"id":"blk-57355","spans":[{"id":"spn-66375","text":"Generate test cases from acceptance criteria"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57356","spans":[{"id":"spn-66376","marks":["code"],"text":"spec_diff"}]},{"id":"blk-57357","spans":[{"id":"spn-66377","text":"Compare two spec versions"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57358","spans":[{"id":"spn-66378","marks":["code"],"text":"spec_search"}]},{"id":"blk-57359","spans":[{"id":"spn-66379","text":"Search FleetPrompt registry"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-57360","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66380","text":"Reference Parsers"}]},{"id":"blk-57361","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66381","text":"Available in "},{"id":"spn-66382","marks":["bold"],"text":"Elixir"},{"id":"spn-66383","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-66384","marks":["bold"],"text":"TypeScript"},{"id":"spn-66385","text":". Formal PEG grammar included in the specification for building conformant parsers."}]},{"id":"blk-57362","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66386","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-57363","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66387","text":"Ecosystem Integration"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-57365","spans":[{"id":"spn-66388","text":"Product"}]},{"id":"blk-57366","spans":[{"id":"spn-66389","text":"How It Uses SpecPrompt"}]}],"id":"blk-57364","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-57367","spans":[{"id":"spn-66390","marks":["bold"],"text":"Agentelic"}]},{"id":"blk-57368","spans":[{"id":"spn-66391","text":"Specs are the primary input to the build pipeline"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57369","spans":[{"id":"spn-66392","marks":["bold"],"text":"OpenSentience"}]},{"id":"blk-57370","spans":[{"id":"spn-66393","text":"Agent manifests reference SPEC.md for permission derivation"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57371","spans":[{"id":"spn-66394","marks":["bold"],"text":"Graphonomous"}]},{"id":"blk-57372","spans":[{"id":"spn-66395","text":"Learning happens within spec-defined boundaries"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57373","spans":[{"id":"spn-66396","marks":["bold"],"text":"FleetPrompt"}]},{"id":"blk-57374","spans":[{"id":"spn-66397","text":"Specs are published as discoverable templates"}]}],[{"id":"blk-57375","spans":[{"id":"spn-66398","marks":["bold"],"text":"Delegatic"}]},{"id":"blk-57376","spans":[{"id":"spn-66399","text":"Multi-agent orchestration specs define agent roles"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-57377","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66400","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-57378","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66401","text":"Interoperability"}]},{"id":"blk-57379","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57381","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66402","marks":["bold"],"text":"AGENTS.md"},{"id":"spn-66403","text":" — complementary (codebase conventions vs. agent behavior specs)"}]}],"id":"blk-57380","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57383","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66404","marks":["bold"],"text":"Next Moca ADL"},{"id":"spn-66405","text":" — bidirectional import/export"}]}],"id":"blk-57382","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57385","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66406","marks":["bold"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-66407","text":" — bidirectional mapping (capabilities, constraints, governance)"}]}],"id":"blk-57384","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-57386","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66408","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-57387","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-66409","text":"Project Links"}]},{"id":"blk-57388","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57390","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66410","marks":["bold"],"text":"Spec:"},{"id":"spn-66411","text":" "},{"id":"spn-66412","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/specprompt.com/docs/spec/README.md"}],"text":"Product Specification"}]}],"id":"blk-57389","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57392","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66413","marks":["bold"],"text":"User stories:"},{"id":"spn-66414","text":" "},{"id":"spn-66415","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/specprompt.com/docs/ux/user-stories.md"}],"text":"SpecPrompt User Stories"}]}],"id":"blk-57391","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57394","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66416","marks":["bold"],"text":"Build prompt:"},{"id":"spn-66417","text":" "},{"id":"spn-66418","marks":[{"kind":"link","predicate":"cites","target":"#/specprompt.com/prompts/BUILD.md"}],"text":"SpecPrompt Implementation Build Prompt"}]}],"id":"blk-57393","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-57396","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66419","marks":["bold"],"text":"[&] Protocol ecosystem:"},{"id":"spn-66420","text":" "},{"id":"spn-66421","marks":["code"],"text":"AmpersandBoxDesign/"}]}],"id":"blk-57395","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-57397","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66422","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-57398","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-66423","text":"*[&] Ampersand Box Design — specprompt.com*"}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierabwqff6l3cxwcmwup2wjpmk3naj3xaqccjmrlrpt4pdkleoktf3vq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}